<blockquote>
<p>To create a draft, you need to get &quot;greenlighted&quot; by at least two experienced people</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This isn't quite true: greenlights are exclusively to post a link to the draft in the Drafts Critique forum for further feedback. We generally don't recommend creating a draft before getting greenlights to ensure new writers don't waste a lot of time writing a SCP that's fundamentally unviable but there's no hard rules against it.</p>
